tashtalk-2.1.3.hex is TashTalk 2.1.3 by Tashtari (lampmerchant), GPL-3.0,
byte-for-byte the release asset of https://github.com/lampmerchant/tashtalk
tag v2.1.3 (sha256 903bd2ad9dccbb1a3003daba4c3e43e621f9daf1f74a10c99efe513cdfb1853c).
Its corresponding source is firmware/one-chip.asm at that tag, included here unmodified as
tashtalk-2.1.3-one-chip.asm (built with Microchip MPASM, as upstream documents).

AirWriter modifies one thing, at runtime, before writing it to the PIC:
CONFIG2 (word 0x8008) is ORed with 0x2000 (LVP on), turning upstream's 0x1FFF
into 0x3FFF, so the ESP32 can reprogram the part without high voltage. See
pic_image_enable_lvp() in pic_prog_core.c. Nothing else differs.
